---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="For Funders"
  description="Grant and funding information for institutional funders interested in supporting Brave for Good's faith-centered family literacy programs."
>

  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="bg-brand-navy text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold">For Institutional Funders</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-2xl">
        Thank you for considering Brave for Good. This page provides the documentation, credentials, and contact information you need to evaluate a grant partnership.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Org credentials -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div>
          <h2 class="section-heading">Organizational Credentials</h2>
          <dl class="mt-8 space-y-5">
            {[
              { label: 'Legal Name',            value: 'Brave for Good, Inc.' },
              { label: 'EIN',                   value: '39-2416029' },
              { label: 'IRS Status',            value: '501(c)(3) Public Charity' },
              { label: 'Year Founded',          value: '2025' },
              { label: 'State of Incorporation', value: 'Texas' },
              { label: 'Fiscal Year',           value: 'January 1 – December 31' },
            ].map(item => (
              <div class="flex">
                <dt class="w-44 shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500">{item.label}</dt>
                <dd class="text-brand-navy font-medium">{item.value}</dd>
              </div>
            ))}
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="section-heading">Financial Documents</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            As a recently incorporated organization, formal financial documents are not yet available. We are happy to provide updated materials as they become available. Please reach out directly with any questions.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <a href="mailto:grants@braveforgood.org" class="btn-secondary text-sm py-2 px-5 inline-block">
              Request Documents
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Program summary -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-cream">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Program Overview</h2>
      <p class="section-subheading mt-3">Brave for Good's primary program is <strong>See You at the Library</strong> — a nationwide initiative hosting faith-centered story hours in public libraries.</p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-brand-navy">Target Population</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Families with children ages 2–12 who seek community programming aligned with faith-based and traditional American values. Events are free and open to the public.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-brand-navy">Theory of Change</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">By providing faith-rooted story resources and convening families in welcoming public spaces, we build social trust, strengthen parental roles in moral formation, and create community ties that persist beyond any single event.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-brand-navy">Geographic Scope</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Nationwide. In 2024 we operated in 46 states. The 2025 goal is all 50 states and 1,000+ library locations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-brand-navy">Outcomes Measured</h3>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-rust">→</span> Number of events hosted and families attended</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-rust">→</span> Geographic reach (states, library systems)</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-rust">→</span> Host retention and repeat events</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-rust">→</span> Attendee satisfaction and likelihood to return</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-rust">→</span> Community connection scores (post-event survey)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-brand-navy">Evaluation Method</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Post-event surveys distributed to hosts and attendees; aggregate data reported semi-annually. We can provide custom reporting for grant-funded programs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Partner contact form -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-navy text-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-3">Ready to Partner With Us?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-10">
        We welcome letters of inquiry and are happy to provide additional materials, schedule a site visit, or arrange a call with our development team.
      </p>

      <form
        name="funder-inquiry"
        method="POST"
        action="https://formspree.io/f/xbdvpgqw"
        class="space-y-5"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Funder Inquiry — Brave for Good" />
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label for="funder-name" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Name</label>
            <input
              id="funder-name"
              type="text"
              name="name"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white placeholder-gray-500 px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-gold focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-gold"
              placeholder="Your full name"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="funder-org" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Organization</label>
            <input
              id="funder-org"
              type="text"
              name="organization"
              class="w-full rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white placeholder-gray-500 px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-gold focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-gold"
              placeholder="Foundation or company name"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label for="funder-email" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Email</label>
            <input
              id="funder-email"
              type="email"
              name="email"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white placeholder-gray-500 px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-gold focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-gold"
              placeholder="you@organization.org"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="funder-phone" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Phone <span class="text-gray-500 font-normal">(optional)</span></label>
            <input
              id="funder-phone"
              type="tel"
              name="phone"
              class="w-full rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white placeholder-gray-500 px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-gold focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-gold"
              placeholder="(000) 000-0000"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="funder-type" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Type of Inquiry</label>
          <select
            id="funder-type"
            name="inquiry_type"
            class="w-full rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-gold focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-gold"
          >
            <option value="" class="text-gray-900">Select one</option>
            <option value="letter-of-inquiry" class="text-gray-900">Letter of Inquiry</option>
            <option value="grant-application" class="text-gray-900">Grant Application</option>
            <option value="site-visit" class="text-gray-900">Site Visit / Call Request</option>
            <option value="documents" class="text-gray-900">Request Financial Documents</option>
            <option value="other" class="text-gray-900">Other</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="funder-message" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Message</label>
          <textarea
            id="funder-message"
            name="message"
            rows="5"
            class="w-full rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white placeholder-gray-500 px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-gold focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-gold resize-none"
            placeholder="Tell us about your foundation and the nature of your inquiry..."
          ></textarea>
        </div>

        <button
          type="submit"
          class="bg-brand-gold text-brand-navy font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-yellow-400 transition-colors"
        >
          Send Inquiry
        </button>

        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 pt-1">
          You can also reach us directly at <a href="mailto:grants@braveforgood.org" class="underline hover:text-white">grants@braveforgood.org</a>
        </p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
